Watch the release-tier check of the bot release pull request, promote main to demo, and merge the release pull request. There is no long-lived release branch: changesets and release-please open one pull request into main per repository.

Usage:
  orbit release [command]

Available Commands:
  check       Watch the release-tier check, or run the release tier against the local dev services
  demo        Promote main to demo through a pull request
  prod        Merge the open release pull request through the merge gate
  status      Report the release pull request, demo branch and last publish or deploy run

Flags:
  -h, --help              help for release
      --manifest string   Path to workspace.yaml

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit release [command] --help" for more information about a command.
